### ==============================================================================
### Navodisha Connect Backend API - Native IntelliJ HTTP Client
### (Click the green Play ▶ button next to any request to execute it directly inside IntelliJ)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@testPhone = +917620149253

### 1. Ping / Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

### 2. Actuator Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Send Phone OTP
# Look in your IntelliJ Run Console tab for the printed 6-digit OTP code!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{testPhone}}"
}

### 4. Verify OTP (Paste the 6-digit OTP from IntelliJ Run console)
# If the user already exists, this automatically returns JWT tokens!
# Replace 123456 below with the actual code from console
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{testPhone}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

> {%
  if (response.body.auth && response.body.auth.accessToken) {
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.auth.accessToken);
    client.log("✅ Auto-saved accessToken: " + response.body.auth.accessToken);
  }
%}

### 5. Register New Student (Instant ACTIVE + Returns JWT Tokens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+918888877777",
  "fullName": "Alok Student",
  "role": "STUDENT",
  "jnvName": "JNV Cuttack"
}

> {%
  if (response.body.accessToken) {
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.log("✅ Auto-saved accessToken: " + response.body.accessToken);
  }
%}

### 6. Register New Alumnus (Sets status = PENDING_VERIFICATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+919999988888",
  "fullName": "Senior Navodayan",
  "role": "ALUMNUS",
  "jnvName": "JNV Nagpur"
}

### 7. Register JNV School Admin (Sets status = PENDING_VERIFICATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+919111122222",
  "fullName": "JNV Principal Sir",
  "role": "JNV_ADMIN",
  "jnvName": "JNV Pune"
}

### 8. Get Authenticated User Profile (Protected - Requires Bearer Token)
# Uses the accessToken automatically captured from registration/login!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Profile Without Token (Expected HTTP 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Accept: application/json
